| `config/cursor-program/README.md` | Pack + AGENTS templates (hub → mssp → consumers) |

**Parallel work:** horeb owns **`claude-ai-orchestration`** PG/O.2. M5 may work hub/pack/macOS/other consumers **only** when paths do not overlap — see parallel-safe lanes SSOT. Never dual-edit the same files without serial push/pull.

**SSH:** Prefer **git pull**. Existing Cloudflare tunnel only if git fails. **Never invent** a new SSH host.

## When dual-host / freeze / catch-up / M5 / horeb / carmel is mentioned

1. **STOP** feature work.  
2. **M5:** load **`docs/M5_READ_ALWAYS.md`** from **main** (above).  
3. Freeze path if still dirty multi-repo: claim `m5/*` → push → PR; **NOTIFY OPERATOR** per single guide.  
4. Catch-up path if freezes merged: run catch-up script; **NOTIFY OPERATOR: M5 catch-up complete**.  
5. **horeb:** orchestration PG/O.2 is horeb lane; do not dual-edit without serial push/pull.  
6. No merge to `main` unless operator orders. No `reset --hard`. No delete `horeb/safety-park-*`.

## Develop / push / PR (always)

| Work | Action |
|------|--------|
| Leave this machine or ship | claim branch → push → **PR** |
| End of day / switch host | **push required** |
| Direct commit to `main` | **Forbidden** |
| Secrets / `target/` / huge binaries | **Never commit** |

**Models:** **`grok/grok-4.5`** (prefer **`grok/grok-4.5`** on gateway); Build loops **`grok/grok-build-0.1`**; not Auto.

